	<li style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"><span style="font-size:12px">Deterioration in profitability metrics &amp; Debt to equity above 3 times.</span></span></li>
	<li style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"><span style="font-size:12px">Impact of any material changes in the market environment on business operations.</span></span></li>
</ul>
</td></tr>
